# Combustion Technique: "deals damage equal to 2 plus the number of Lesson cards in your graveyard to target creature. If that creature
# would die this turn, exile it instead." Bot1's graveyard is empty, so it deals 2 damage to Bot2's Llanowar Elves; the Elves would die,
# and are exiled instead of going to the graveyard (CR 614.1a, 700.4). The spell itself, on the stack as it resolves, is not a Lesson
# card in the graveyard to count.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Combustion Technique
Island x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Forest x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Combustion Technique.Cast(Llanowar Elves)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Turn = 3
Stack.Count = 0
Exile = Llanowar Elves
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 0
Bot2.Battlefield = Forest
Bot1.Graveyard = Combustion Technique
